// (lops.js gemv / lops_spec.js gemvM), per call shape. 'v5' = ND output rows per thread x L lanes of 32-weight groups, one 16-byte weight
// load per row per group, x staged in workgroup memory or read direct (the same values), the lane partials summed as whole vec4s.
// A call's decode (gemv) and verify (gemvM) take the same options (PICK is keyed by prologue.epilogue.NxK), so on a desktop GPU a verify
